title: Make the experimental collator proto the default for Kusama
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The binary checks if a Kusama chainspec is loaded and enables the experimental collator protocol
    by default unless `experimental-collator-protocol` parameter is passed explicitly. In that case
    its value is respected no matter what the chainspec is.
crates:
- name: polkadot-cli
  bump: patch
